## Today's little listen · 今天的一句

<div class="fused-card">

### 你 好

Nǐ hǎo · Hello

Listen first. Understand more. You do not have to catch every word.

**01 Listen — 先听一遍 · 02 Notice — 注意声调 · 03 Say it — 跟着说一遍**

mā · má · mǎ · mà

