## Today's one movement · 今天的一个动作

<div class="fused-card">

### 起 势

Qǐ shì · Opening — stand, breathe, lift slowly

No flexibility needed. No uniform. Ten minutes in the park, at home, or in your garden is enough.

**01 Stand — 站稳 · 02 Breathe — 呼吸 · 03 Lift — 慢慢起手**

